operation (required): diff | append.

For diff:
  find (required): exact text block to replace. Include 2-4 surrounding lines for uniqueness.
  replace_with: replacement text (empty = delete). Keep existing lines you want to preserve.
  On AMBIGUOUS error: use the match_sites context excerpts to widen find until unique, retry.

For append:
  text (required): text to add at document end.
  ensure_newline: true/false (default true).

document_id (required): Google Docs ID.
